{"id":"wb-8-295","name":"椒江戚继光祠","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T12:17:41+00:00","status":"ready","title":"戚继光祠 (台州)","text":"戚继光祠即海门卫城隍庙暨戚公祠，位于中国浙江省台州市椒江区老城内（原海门卫城）东山西南麓、戚继光路100号。\n\n始建于明初，嘉靖时戚继光曾任台金严参将并在此屯兵抗倭，现为清同治、光绪时重修，中轴线上依次为照壁、河桥、前殿、戏台、池、池桥、看楼（东西设翼楼）和大殿（东西设偏殿）。1987年辟为戚继光纪念馆，内设《戚继光抗倭史迹陈列》。2019年10月16日入选第八批全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":true,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%88%9A%E7%BB%A7%E5%85%89%E7%A5%A0_(%E5%8F%B0%E5%B7%9E)","revisionId":94848786,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=94848786","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/8dbf4d8d09e2c65d8f3d6637.jpg","title":"椒江戚继光祠,_2022-02-14_08.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E6%A4%92%E6%B1%9F%E6%88%9A%E7%BB%A7%E5%85%89%E7%A5%A0,_2022-02-14_08.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/62/%E6%A4%92%E6%B1%9F%E6%88%9A%E7%BB%A7%E5%85%89%E7%A5%A0%2C_2022-02-14_08.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Siyuwj","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​椒江戚继光祠","width":320,"height":214},"textScope":"body-excerpt"}